@startuml navigation_system_architecture
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

title gn10_navigation システム全体構成およびノード間通信図

package "設定ファイル (config/)" {
    [costmap_params.yaml] as CfgCostmap
    [path_planner_params.yaml] as CfgPlanner
    [path_follower_params.yaml] as CfgFollower
    [shooting_points_*.yaml] as CfgPoints
    [nhk2026_map.json] as CfgMapJson
}

package "gn10_navigation ノード群" {
    node "target_manager_node" as TargetMgr
    node "costmap_generator_node" as CostmapGen
    node "path_planner_node" as Planner
    node "path_follower_node" as Follower
    node "moving_bucket_launcher_node" as MovingBucketLauncher
}

package "外部システム / ハードウェア / TF" {
    [TF: /tf, /tf_static\n(map -> base_link, bucket_bottom)] as TF
    [上位司令 / UI\n/robot/target_id\n/robot/navigation_command] as UpperCmd
    [足回りモーター制御\n/robot/operation/cmd_vel] as BaseActuator
    [投擲機構制御\n/robot/operation/belt_launcher_speed] as LauncherActuator
    [LiDAR認識系 (LPS)\n/bucket_opening_tracker/bottom] as BucketPerception
    [電源状態\n/robot/feedback/drive_battery_voltage] as BatteryStatus
}

CfgMapJson --> CostmapGen : 地図オブジェクト読み込み
CfgCostmap --> CostmapGen : パラメータ読み込み
CfgPlanner --> Planner : パラメータ読み込み
CfgFollower --> Follower : パラメータ読み込み
CfgPoints --> TargetMgr : 目標投擲点読み込み

UpperCmd --> TargetMgr : /robot/target_id (uint8)\n/robot/navigation_command (uint8)
UpperCmd --> Follower : /robot/navigation_command (uint8)\n/robot/target_id (uint8)
UpperCmd --> MovingBucketLauncher : /robot/target_id (uint8)\n/robot/navigation_command (uint8)

BucketPerception --> MovingBucketLauncher : /bucket_opening_tracker/bottom (BucketBottom)
BatteryStatus --> MovingBucketLauncher : /robot/feedback/drive_battery_voltage (Float32)
TF --> MovingBucketLauncher : map -> base_link

TargetMgr --> Planner : /goal_pose (PoseStamped)
TargetMgr --> LauncherActuator : /robot/operation/belt_launcher_speed (Float32)\n(target_id != MovingBucket)
MovingBucketLauncher --> LauncherActuator : /robot/operation/belt_launcher_speed (Float32)\n(target_id == MovingBucket のみ配信)

CostmapGen --> Planner : /costmap (OccupancyGrid)

TF --> Planner : map -> base_link
Planner --> Follower : /planned_path (Path)

TF --> Follower : map -> base_link\nmap -> bucket_bottom
Follower --> BaseActuator : /robot/operation/cmd_vel (Twist)
Follower --> UpperCmd : /robot/operation/navigation_status (uint8)

note right of MovingBucketLauncher
  <b>移動バケツ追従射出速度計算:</b>
  - TargetId::MovingBucket (ID 0) のみ配信
  - target_manager_node とのトピック干渉を完全回避
  - バケツ底相対距離(L)・高低差(Δz)から弾道逆算
  - バッテリー電圧低下補正 & 速度上下限クランプ
end note

note right of CostmapGen
  <b>主要パラメータ:</b>
  - publish_rate, resolution, map_bounds.*
  - robot_clearance.z_min / z_max
  - inflation.robot_radius, inflation.margin
end note

note right of Planner
  <b>主要パラメータ:</b>
  - a_star.planning_cost, snap_distance
  - bspline.smoothing_strength, smoothing_iterations
  - bspline.max_stride, smooth_max_cost
  - rotation_planning.turn_max_cost, turn_distance
  - footprint.polygon
end note

note right of Follower
  <b>主要パラメータ:</b>
  - max_speed, max_acceleration, max_deceleration
  - position_kp, position_ki, max_fb_speed
  - settle_zone_distance, min_docking_speed
  - heading_kp, ki, kd, min_docking_yaw_rate
  - goal_tolerance, goal_yaw_tolerance, goal_settle_count
end note

@enduml
